<section><h2>Important limitations</h2>
<p>These results apply to the selected source dataset and temporal split. Verify dataset provenance,
feature availability at prediction time, and the timestamp semantics. No candidate is automatically
deployed. The final test must not be repeatedly reused for model selection.</p></section>
